2	PHP_CodeSniffer\Standards\Squiz\Sniffs\PHP\HeredocSniff.HeredocNotAllowed	Use of heredoc syntax (<<<EOD) is not allowed; use standard strings or inline HTML instead
8	PHP_CodeSniffer\Standards\Squiz\Sniffs\PHP\HeredocSniff.NowdocNotAllowed	Use of nowdoc syntax (<<<'EOT') is not allowed; use standard strings or inline HTML instead
